            What Agents Look Like Across Different Kinds of Businesses
          </h2>
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
            <div style="padding: 20px; background: var(--bg-cream-alt); border-radius: 8px;">
              <strong style="color: var(--ink-black); font-size: 1.05rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Professional Services</strong>
              <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Intake triage, client brief synthesis, meeting prep, and precedent research removing unbilled admin friction.</p>
